[{"hash":"e7c87ceebf7c061523d47a71281b2fe086c0f64b","date":"2026-09-29T04:04:40.000Z","title":"Load an app's icon again when it relaunches","paragraphs":["The icon cache kept an app's icon for as long as the taskbar ran, so an app that got a new icon (Tandem, rebuilt with one) kept showing the old or blank one until the taskbar restarted. Icons now remember the processes they were loaded for, and a new process for the same app loads the icon again, showing the old one until the new one arrives. A closed pinned app and a process already seen don't reload."]},{"hash":"91359892bed76dd7db3c7cfea15138062f06d488","date":"2026-09-24T06:20:40.000Z","title":"Add Telemprompit teleprompter and shared PrompterKit package (#62)","paragraphs":["* Add Telemprompit teleprompter and shared PrompterKit package","Telemprompit is a native macOS teleprompter that opens on the Elgato Prompter (or the main screen when it is off), parses pasted notes and Notion bullet lists, and steps through them line by line or auto-scrolls. It has a drag handle, resize grip, persisted settings, mirroring, global clicker keys, and telemprompit:// URL commands.","The prompter display lookup and DisplayLink switch move from Taskbar into tools/lib/PrompterKit so Taskbar, Video HQ and Telemprompit share them.","* Telemprompit: add website header image","* Telemprompit: note how to re-render the header","* Telemprompit: address review feedback","- Keep the reader on the same line when edits insert or remove lines above it\n- Keep tag-shaped text inside code spans; match fence lengths\n- Build the settings window once so the script editor keeps undo and caret\n- Publish the current display to settings, validate menu items\n- Clamp side margins to the window width; show full code blocks\n- kill.sh waits for exit; launcher refuses to reuse a dying instance\n- Stable signing requirement whenever the identity is ad hoc\n- PrompterKit: singleton-only DisplayLink controller; Video HQ uses prompterScreen()","* Telemprompit: say whether the prompter is connected when the window is elsewhere","---------"]},{"hash":"e7b569122f8f468380fbc33c3b3142520f9b92c1","date":"2026-09-17T01:51:00.000Z","title":"Open Record It with studio controls","paragraphs":[]},{"hash":"894947429aae9aad54b65a6d4e2fe5dc5e3fbac5","date":"2026-09-07T21:44:38.000Z","title":"React to window focus changes and show windowless running apps","paragraphs":[]},{"hash":"698ac0c7fa5c7049472c2a0b697b8993b3934c6b","date":"2026-09-07T04:41:28.000Z","title":"Show Dock badges and fit compact taskbar stats values","paragraphs":[]},{"hash":"6104b4386b3271bf024d9dd712e350ea4eb2a737","date":"2026-09-07T04:32:10.000Z","title":"Fix crowded taskbar widths and prioritize selected labels","paragraphs":[]},{"hash":"ea05aad2436054575f6c6d7c934b69403b500ffe","date":"2026-08-19T05:55:01.000Z","title":"Scale studio display with lights","paragraphs":[]},{"hash":"5f22717a14bffeb242b954c4590cf81e31d664bd","date":"2026-08-17T12:41:43.000Z","title":"Toggle Elgato Prompter with studio lights (#57)","paragraphs":[]},{"hash":"8db8c19e2485aa760265a524cf58b4e18cac5a9f","date":"2026-08-17T03:34:54.000Z","title":"Support per-monitor lights widget overrides","paragraphs":[]},{"hash":"201782e67a928a676fd3c13a1927cd774371643b","date":"2026-08-17T03:34:54.000Z","title":"Add Control Center lights taskbar widget","paragraphs":[]},{"hash":"48c26d416dcd04dd8af7e039237d9f287992569f","date":"2026-08-15T13:02:21.000Z","title":"Add taskbar hover and cursor handoff (#56)","paragraphs":["* Add taskbar hover and cursor handoff","* Keep taskbar hover aligned after layout changes","* Refresh taskbar hover after resizing"]},{"hash":"277198a7aa04dd55d950da29a8232bdc50d1a14a","date":"2026-07-27T01:58:45.000Z","title":"Fix taskbar monitor settings identity","paragraphs":[]},{"hash":"8b188f0b5716f2f3e8326736adc1736cf8941c1a","date":"2026-07-22T22:43:43.000Z","title":"Refine taskbar battery and widget spacing","paragraphs":[]},{"hash":"aa0ed8beab1a249fe01fe669c32dd347425b